# Assembler and compiler output. The sources here are built by hand with several
# toolchains, so the object extensions come from all of them: NASM and the GNU
# assembler write .obj and .o, FreePascal writes .o and .ppu, and a bare link
# with no -o leaves a.out.
*.obj
*.o
*.ppu
*.exe
a.out

# Editor temporaries. Far Manager writes FARxxxx.tmp beside the file being
# edited, and a numbered scratch dump is how output gets eyeballed here.
FAR*.tmp
1.txt

# Credential-bearing tool configuration, which belongs on the machine and never
# in the history: this file carries the token the githubapi plugin authenticates
# with, and a commit here could not be withdrawn.
githubapi.config.json

# Local tooling metadata
/.project/
